{"root":"tengkar","ipa":"/təŋkar/","core":"争吵、吵架，指人与人之间因意见不合或冲突而发生的言语争执。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/təŋkar/","zh":"争吵，吵架","phrases":[{"t":"tengkar mulut","zh":"口角，争吵"},{"t":"sering tengkar","zh":"经常吵架"},{"t":"jangan tengkar","zh":"不要吵架"}],"examples":[{"t":"Mereka selalu tengkar karena masalah sepele.","zh":"他们总是因为琐事而吵架。"},{"t":"Pasangan itu tidak pernah tengkar di depan anak-anak.","zh":"那对夫妻从不在孩子面前吵架。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"tengkar","ipa":"/təŋkar/","zh":"争吵","phrase":{"t":"tengkar hebat","zh":"激烈争吵"},"example":{"t":"Kami tidak ingin tengkar lagi.","zh":"我们不想再吵架了。"}},{"w":"bertengkar","ipa":"/bərtəŋkar/","zh":"吵架，争执","phrase":{"t":"bertengkar dengan teman","zh":"和朋友吵架"},"example":{"t":"Adik dan kakak sedang bertengkar di kamar.","zh":"弟弟和哥哥正在房间里吵架。"}},{"w":"pertengkaran","ipa":"/pərtəŋkaran/","zh":"争吵，纠纷","phrase":{"t":"awal pertengkaran","zh":"争吵的起因"},"example":{"t":"Pertengkaran itu berakhir dengan damai.","zh":"那场争吵以和平方式结束了。"}},{"w":"mempertengkarkan","ipa":"/məmpərtəŋkarkan/","zh":"争论某事，争执某事","phrase":{"t":"mempertengkarkan harta","zh":"争夺财产"},"example":{"t":"Mereka mempertengkarkan hak asuh anak.","zh":"他们正在争论孩子的抚养权问题。"}}],"derSlugs":["tengkar","bertengkar","pertengkaran","mempertengkarkan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:22:31.584Z","src":"base"}